sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FE as Frontend VisionStatus
    participant API as /api/v1/health
    participant DB as Database
    participant R as Redis/Broker
    participant MS as Midscene Runner /health

    FE->>API: GET /health
    alt cache hit
        API-->>FE: cached response
    else cache miss
        par DB probe
            API->>DB: SELECT 1
            DB-->>API: ok/down
        and Celery/Redis probe
            API->>R: ping broker redis
            R-->>API: ok/down
        and Midscene probe
            API->>MS: GET /health
            MS-->>API: 200 -> ok / else down
        end
        API->>API: aggregate service states
        API-->>FE: healthy/degraded + services.midscene
    end

    FE->>FE: render Midscene visual executor status
